column18:
The Scaled Map shall draw the Very High Frequency Omnidirectional Range (VOR) stations, Type D, as a line icon with center dot with vertices of the two overlapping shapes (x,y):
{0.57735f, 1.0f}, {1.15470f, 0.0f},
{0.57735f, -1.0f}, {-0.57735f, -1.0f},
{-1.15470f, 0.0f}, {-0.57735f, 1.0f}

{1.15470f, 1.0f}, {1.15470f, -1.0f}, 
{-1.15470f, -1.0f}, {-1.15470f, 1.0f}

The Scaled Map shall draw airports as a 12-sided circle with a radius of 0.80 and a cross in the center with the following vertices (x,y):
{0.2, -1.0}, {0.2, 1.0},
{-0.2, -1.0}, {-0.2, 1.0}

{-1.0, 0.2}, {1.0, 0.2},
{-1.0, -0.2}, {1.0, -0.2}
